{title: Nos Levantou}
{artist: Lagoinha Tampa Music}
{tempo: 70}
{time: 4/4}

{c: Intro}
[Bb] [Dm] [C]

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Move meu interior[C]
MOVE MY INNERMOST BEING
[Bb]Põe o fogo que preciso queimar
PUT IN THE FIRE I NEED TO BURN
[Dm]Move me pelo que És[C]
MOVE ME BY WHO YOU ARE
Através do [Gm]fogo no [Bb]Teu Ol[C]har
THROUGH THE FIRE IN YOUR GAZE

{c: Verse 2}
[Dm]Quero ser as Tuas mãos[C]
I WANT TO BE YOUR HANDS
[Bb]Sentir com o Teu coração
TO FEEL WITH YOUR HEART
[Dm]Ir onde os teus pés irão[C]
TO GO WHERE YOUR FEET WILL GO
[Gm]Transbordar amor que a [Bb]cruz derra[C]mou
TO OVERFLOW WITH THE LOVE THE CROSS POURED OUT

{c: Chorus}
[Bb]Ele veio e viu
HE CAME AND HE SAW
E com Seu amor
AND WITH HIS LOVE
Curou a nossa dor
HE HEALED OUR PAIN
E nos levantou
AND HE LIFTED US UP

{c: Bridge}
[Bb]Agora posso amar assim como [C]Ele amou
NOW I CAN LOVE JUST AS HE LOVED
[Bb]Posso Tocar quem Ele quer to[C]car
I CAN TOUCH WHOEVER HE WANTS TO TOUCH
